WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Lie on the belly, hands under the shoulders, legs extended back.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Press the tops of the feet and pubic bone down.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Inhale and lift the chest, drawing the shoulders back.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep a slight bend in the elbows and the neck long.
